<section class="gg-hero">
  <div class="gg-bg-orb orb-one"></div>
  <div class="gg-bg-orb orb-two"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-hero-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower App</span>
      <h1>A garden for the life you're trying to build.</h1>
      <p>
        Every goal becomes a plant. Every action helps it grow.
        Stay consistent, build meaningful habits, and watch your progress come to life.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="#walkthrough" class="gg-btn-soft">See How It Works</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-phone-showcase reveal">
      <div class="gg-floating-stat stat-1">
        <strong>24</strong>
        <span>Goals Watered</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-floating-stat stat-2">
        <strong>7</strong>
        <span>Day Streak</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-floating-stat stat-3">
        <strong>3</strong>
        <span>Shared Gardens</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-android-phone main-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-mini-phone phone-float-one">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker small"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '600x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower goals list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-app-walkthrough" id="walkthrough">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">How It Works</span>
      <h2>Your goals become something you can see.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and long-term goals into a living visual system.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-walkthrough-stack">
      <div class="gg-walk-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-walk-copy">
          <span>Step 1</span>
          <h3>Create a goal</h3>
          <p>Choose what you want to grow and give it a clear purpose.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-walk-phone">
          {{ 'gg-add-goal-saving-read-more-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Create a goal screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-walk-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-walk-copy">
          <span>Step 2</span>
          <h3>Track the details</h3>
          <p>See progress, milestones, and the goal you are building toward.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-walk-phone">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-walk-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-walk-copy">
          <span>Step 3</span>
          <h3>Place it in your garden</h3>
          <p>Your goal becomes a living plant that reflects your effort.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-walk-phone">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-section gg-story">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The Story</span>
      <h2>Most goal apps feel like pressure. Goal Grower feels like returning.</h2>
      <p>
        Built for imperfect days, fresh starts, long-term goals, and motivation
        that feels human instead of harsh.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-card-grid">
      <div class="gg-info-card reveal">
        <span class="gg-number">01</span>
        <h3>Plant a goal</h3>
        <p>Create a habit, project, school goal, health goal, or personal dream.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-info-card reveal">
        <span class="gg-number">02</span>
        <h3>Water it with action</h3>
        <p>Your effort becomes visible as your plant grows through progress.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-info-card reveal">
        <span class="gg-number">03</span>
        <h3>Come back again</h3>
        <p>Goal Grower helps you restart without shame and keep growing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-section gg-dark-band">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Why It Feels Different</span>
      <h2>A goal tracker with emotional feedback.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-function-list reveal">
      <div>
        <strong>Personal garden</strong>
        <span>See your goals in one visual, calming place.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Shared gardens</strong>
        <span>Grow with friends, family, classmates, or accountability partners.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Living progress</strong>
        <span>Your effort becomes something you can see, care about, and return to.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Big goals and habits</strong>
        <span>Track daily routines and long-term goals in the same system.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

