  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">App Preview</span>
      <h2>From empty garden to visible growth.</h2>
      <p>
        Create goals, place them in your garden, track progress, and see each
        goal become something visual.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-phone-grid gg-phone-grid-large">
      <div class="gg-android-phone reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'No goals screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-android-phone reveal featured-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-add-goal-saving-read-more-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Add goal screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-android-phone reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-android-phone reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goals list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-android-phone reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-shared-garden-section">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Shared Gardens</span>
      <h2>Grow together.</h2>
      <p>
        Create a garden with friends, family, classmates, roommates, spouses,
        or accountability partners. Everyone grows their own goals while contributing
        to a shared space.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-shared-card reveal">
      <h3>Everyone contributes.</h3>

      <ul>
        <li>Shared visual progress</li>
        <li>Group accountability</li>
        <li>Encouragement without pressure</li>
        <li>Collaborative growth</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-section gg-growth-journey">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Growth Journey</span>
      <h2>Watch goals come alive.</h2>
      <p>
        The app turns progress into a simple emotional loop: start small, show up,
        grow, and return.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-growth-steps">
      <div class="gg-growth-step reveal">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Seed</h3>
        <p>Create a goal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-step reveal">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Sprout</h3>
        <p>Take your first actions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-step reveal">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Plant</h3>
        <p>Build consistency.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-step reveal">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Bloom</h3>
        <p>Reach meaningful milestones.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-section gg-roadmap">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Roadmap</span>
      <h2>Built in public, growing over time.</h2>
      <p>
        Support helps turn Goal Grower from a working beta into a polished app.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-roadmap-grid">
      <div class="gg-roadmap-card reveal done">
