      </div>

      <div class="gg-roadmap-card reveal">
        <span>Future</span>
        <h3>Widgets and reminders</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-section gg-creator">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Built By A Student</span>
      <h2>Why I made Goal Grower.</h2>
      <p>
        I wanted a goal tracker that felt encouraging instead of stressful.
        Something visual. Something alive. Something that makes progress feel
        worth returning to.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-creator-card reveal">
      <h3>Current progress</h3>

      <ul>
        <li>Goal tracking built</li>
        <li>Personal gardens built</li>
        <li>Shared gardens in beta</li>
        <li>Android testing next</li>
        <li>App store release future</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-section gg-products-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Store</span>
      <h2>Support the app and future products.</h2>
      <p>
        The store is organized around support, digital tools, and physical products
        connected to intentional growth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-product-lanes">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-lane-card reveal">
        <span class="gg-lane-label">Main</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower Support</h3>
        <p>Help fund development, design, testing, and future features.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-lane-card reveal">
        <span class="gg-lane-label">Tools</span>
        <h3>Digital Products</h3>
        <p>Templates, planners, resources, and tools for intentional growth.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-lane-card reveal">
        <span class="gg-lane-label">Objects</span>
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Merch, desk items, calming productivity objects, and future products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-final-cta">
  <div class="gg-container reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The Mission</span>
    <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is about making progress feel human, hopeful, and worth caring about.
    </p>

    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support the Mission</a>
  </div>
</section>

